              "text": "On November 3, 2025, at approximately 07:00 UTC, the Aldan House collapse destroyed the building and east wing on Cobbett Row, prompting assistance requests in Imber Street and Nerridge; PUSAR deployed shortly after, with rescue operations confirming injuries and rescuing 9 people by Nerridge fire service by 09:50 UTC.",
