            },
            {
              "id": "2a.2",
              "text": "By November 8, 2025, authorities confirmed deaths from the collapse, displaced about 85 people from Cobbett Row due to dangerous conditions, restored the tower crane in Imber Street, and completed transfers in Cobbett Row, while police maintained deployment and no looting was reported.",
